@startuml
participant "Axios / refreshFlight" as UI
participant Gateway
participant "AuthController / CsrfGuard" as Controller
participant AuthService
participant "PrismaSessionRepository" as Sessions
database identity_db
UI -> UI : concurrent 401 -> one refresh promise
UI -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/auth/refresh + HttpOnly cookie
Gateway -> Controller : forward cookie/Origin/CSRF/correlation
Controller -> AuthService : refresh(opaqueToken)
AuthService -> AuthService : SHA-256 + generate new random token
AuthService -> Sessions : rotate(oldHash,newSession)
Sessions -> identity_db : find old session
Sessions -> identity_db : BEGIN; per-user advisory lock
Sessions -> identity_db : reread session + user
alt active unexpired session + ACTIVE user
  Sessions -> identity_db : revoke old; insert new in same family; COMMIT
  Sessions --> AuthService : user
  AuthService --> Controller : new JWT/session + opaque token
  Controller --> UI : through Gateway: 200 + rotated HttpOnly cookie
  UI -> UI : retry original requests once with new access
else replay/revoked/expired/locked
  Sessions -> identity_db : revoke active family; COMMIT
  Sessions --> AuthService : null
  AuthService --> Controller : 401
  Controller --> UI : clear cookie; 401 envelope
  UI -> UI : clear memory auth; login required
end
note over Sessions,identity_db
Revocation commits before reporting replay failure.
Old access JWT fails Identity live-session validation.
end note
@enduml
